/**
 * Admin validation controller for UCKK faculty profiles.
 *
 * This page validates the Faculty JSON layer and its safe link to the Atlas
 * layer. It is intentionally read-only:
 *
 * - it never accepts file paths from request parameters;
 * - it resolves faculty profiles only through the manifest/registry layer;
 * - it validates profiles through faculty_validator;
 * - it can validate linked Atlas Voies through voie_validator;
 * - it writes no Moodle courses, badges, grades, completions, enrolments or JSON files;
 * - it logs only identifiers, counts, statuses and hashes.
 *
 * @package    local_uckk
 * @copyright  2026 Univers-Cité King Klown
 * @license    https://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later
 */

